{"product_id":"a-feast-for-crows-a-song-of-ice-and-fire-book-4","title":"A Feast for Crows (A Song of Ice and Fire, Book 4)","description":"\u003cp\u003eHBO s hit series A GAME OF THRONES is based on George R R Martin s internationally bestselling series A SONG OF ICE AND FIRE, the greatest fantasy epic of the modern age. A FEAST FOR CROWS is the fourth volume in the series.On the morning after battle, the crows had feasted on victors and vanquished alike. How much can a crown be worth, when a crow can dine upon a king?A Lannister sits upon the Iron Throne. But the days of betrayal and bloodshed are far from over.Among the ashes of war, new conflicts spark to life. Daring new plots and dangerous new alliances are formed which threaten to engulf Westeros. But in this game of thrones, victory will go to those with the sharpest steel and the coldest hearts.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: George R.R. Martin\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780007548279\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 864\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45145496813721,"sku":"8RD9780007548279","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67ada0c97c2e8_A_20Feast_20for_20Crows_20_A_20Song_20of_20Ice_20and_20Fire_20Book_204_20George_20R.R._20Martin.jpg?v=1739467110","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/a-feast-for-crows-a-song-of-ice-and-fire-book-4","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}